{"id":"torrey:afflicted-duty-toward-the","source":"torrey","name":"Afflicted, Duty Toward The","slug":"afflicted-duty-toward-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"To pray for them — Ac 12:5; Php 1:16,19; Jas 5:14-16.","refs":[["Acts",12,5,12,5],["Phil",1,16,1,16],["Phil",1,19,1,19],["Jas",5,14,5,16]]},{"text":"To sympathise with them — Ro 12:15; Ga 6:2.","refs":[["Rom",12,15,12,15],["Gal",6,2,6,2]]},{"text":"To pity them — Job 6:14.","refs":[["Job",6,14,6,14]]},{"text":"To bear them in mind — Heb 13:3.","refs":[["Heb",13,3,13,3]]},{"text":"To visit them — Jas 1:27.","refs":[["Jas",1,27,1,27]]},{"text":"To comfort them — Job 16:5; 29:25; 2Co 1:4; 1Th 4:18.","refs":[["Job",16,5,16,5],["Job",29,25,29,25],["2Cor",1,4,1,4],["1Thess",4,18,4,18]]},{"text":"To relieve them — Job 31:19,20; Isa 58:10; Php 4:14; 1Ti 5:10.","refs":[["Job",31,19,31,19],["Job",31,20,31,20],["Isa",58,10,58,10],["Phil",4,14,4,14],["1Tim",5,10,5,10]]},{"text":"To protect them — Ps 82:3; Pr 22:22; 31:5.","refs":[["Ps",82,3,82,3],["Prov",22,22,22,22],["Prov",31,5,31,5]]}],"refCount":21}
